<title>JAPAN: BOJ governor to visit Washington Sept 27-Oct 3.</title>
<headline>BOJ governor to visit Washington Sept 27-Oct 3.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank of Japan (BOJ) Governor Yasuo Matsushita will visit the United States from September 27 to October 3 to attend meetings of the International Monetary Fund and the World Bank in Washington, the central bank said in a statement.</p>
</text>
